---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work With Emon Hossain | AI Systems & Automation"
  description="Ways to work with Emon Hossain on AI systems, workflow automation, operational design, workshops and advisory. Scope, timeline and pricing are confirmed per engagement."
  ogTitle="Work With Emon Hossain — AI Systems & Automation"
>
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">WORK WITH ME</div>
      <h2>Start with the problem, not a package.</h2>
      <p>I do not publish fixed prices or performance promises until the actual scope, delivery requirements and evidence needs are clear.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">DIAGNOSE</div>
        <h3>AI Systems Diagnostic</h3>
        <div class="desc">Map a workflow, identify bottlenecks and decide where automation or AI is genuinely useful.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Current-state workflow review</li>
          <li>Bottleneck and handoff analysis</li>
          <li>Automation opportunity map</li>
          <li>Prioritized next steps</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">BUILD</div>
        <h3>Automation & Systems Implementation</h3>
        <div class="desc">Design and implement a bounded workflow or operational system with clear ownership, testing and handoff.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Workflow and system architecture</li>
          <li>Low-code automation where appropriate</li>
          <li>AI-assisted steps with review controls</li>
          <li>Documentation and acceptance criteria</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">ENABLE</div>
        <h3>Workshop & Advisory</h3>
        <div class="desc">Practical sessions for founders, teams or communities that need clarity on applied AI, automation and workflow design.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Use-case and tool evaluation</li>
          <li>Team workflow mapping</li>
          <li>AI adoption and operating guidance</li>
          <li>Custom session scope</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width:48rem;margin:3rem auto 0;padding:2rem;background:white;border:1px solid var(--brand-stone-200);border-radius:1rem;text-align:center;">
      <h3 style="font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Commercial delivery context</h3>
      <p style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--brand-stone-600);margin-top:.65rem;line-height:1.7;">Commercial AI-systems work may be delivered through SYSmoAI where appropriate. The responsible entity, scope, timeline, price, deliverables and acceptance criteria should be confirmed in writing before work begins.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">Discuss a Project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
